{
 "duration": 35.42,
 "cues": [
  {
   "text": "In nineteen seventy-seven, an eleven-year-old girl began speaking in the voice of a man.",
   "start": 0.1,
   "end": 6.34
  },
  {
   "text": "A man who said he was dead.",
   "start": 6.59,
   "end": 8.82
  },
  {
   "text": "August. Enfield, North London.",
   "start": 9.27,
   "end": 11.71
  },
  {
   "text": "In a small house on Green Street, Peggy Hodgson hears her children screaming.",
   "start": 11.91,
   "end": 16.77
  },
  {
   "text": "The furniture is moving.",
   "start": 16.97,
   "end": 19.0
  },
  {
   "text": "Then comes the knocking. Inside the walls.",
   "start": 19.3,
   "end": 22.51
  },
  {
   "text": "A police officer is called.",
   "start": 22.86,
   "end": 25.09
  },
  {
   "text": "She reports a chair sliding across the floor.",
   "start": 25.24,
   "end": 28.38
  },
  {
   "text": "No one is touching it.",
   "start": 28.58,
   "end": 30.23
  },
  {
   "text": "And that was only the beginning.",
   "start": 30.63,
   "end": 32.95
  },
  {
   "text": "Part two. The voice.",
   "start": 33.25,
   "end": 34.82
  }
 ]
}